{
  "description": "Retrieval evaluation for the Slotly demo knowledge base. 'expect' lists document slugs that must appear among the relevant (within RAG_MAX_DISTANCE) top-k results; 'forbid' lists slugs that must not appear; 'answerable: false' cases must produce no relevant results.",
